---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  locale="en"
  slug="contact"
  title="Contact — KickoffWhen"
  description="Found a bug? Wrong match time? Translation off in Korean or Traditional Chinese? Send us a note via GitHub Issues or email."
  pageHeading="Contact"
>

  <p>
    KickoffWhen is a solo project. The fastest way to reach us is via the public issue tracker.
  </p>

  <h2>GitHub Issues — preferred</h2>
  <p>
    Bugs, wrong match times, broken calendar files, design suggestions, feature requests:
  </p>
  <p>
    👉
    <a href="https://github.com/yubudong/kickoffwhen/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      github.com/yubudong/kickoffwhen/issues
    </a>
  </p>
  <p>
    Public issues let everyone see what's been reported, helps duplicates, and is searchable. Even a
    one-line "match 47 venue is wrong, it's Estadio Akron not BMO Field" report is enormously helpful.
  </p>

  <h2>Translation feedback</h2>
  <p>
    The site is currently in 4 languages — English (native), 日本語 (polished with reference glossary),
    한국어 (machine-translated, no native review yet), 繁體中文 (Taiwan usage, machine-translated).
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are a native speaker of <strong>Korean or Traditional Chinese</strong> and notice anything
    that reads awkward, please open a GitHub issue with the page URL and the suggested fix. It will be
    merged within a day or two.
  </p>

  <h2>Email (for things that shouldn't be public)</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy concerns, takedown requests, or sensitive matters:
    <a href="mailto:hello@kickoffwhen.com">hello@kickoffwhen.com</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    Please note: this is a personal project, so we reply when we can — usually within 48 hours.
  </p>

  <h2>What we can't help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Match streaming — we don't host video. Try the official broadcaster in your country.</li>
    <li>Tickets — see the official FIFA ticketing site.</li>
    <li>Betting — see <a href="/terms/">our terms</a>.</li>
  </ul>

</LegalLayout>
